{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國國防部27日公布，中國駐菲律賓使館國防武官將作為中方代表，於29日出席在菲律賓宿霧舉行的第13屆東盟防長擴大會議。</p><p>北京《環球時報》指，這是2010年首屆東協防長擴大會舉行以來，中方參會官員等級最低的一次。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:21:56.402266+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T06:31:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:58:09.870078+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:16.237919+00:00","content_hash":"cc20c2a44d04537c4b7da99637bfdd40c84008aa71b797bd8298c396aaa5a813","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}